# Nothing here is required. The stack runs on a local DuckDB file with no accounts, no keys
# and no .env at all -- copy this to .env (git-ignored) only if you want to change a default.
#
# dbt reads this file directly as well as the refarch CLI, so one copy serves both.

# dbt target: dev builds refarch_dev_* schemas, prod builds refarch_*. Both live in the same
# DuckDB file.
# DBT_TARGET=dev

# Where the warehouse file lives. Defaults to warehouse/refarch.duckdb in this repo.
# REFARCH_WAREHOUSE=/absolute/path/to/refarch.duckdb
